OL,3,GNEWSAEvery day is living hell, says dad
OL,4,Aof boy, 2, murdered by grandparents    
OL,6,FA review into Ethan's death found that 
OL,7,Fhis father, Will Griffiths, raised     
OL,8,Fconcerns about his safety, but they    
OL,9,Fwere not acted on, and opportunities to
OL,10,Fprotect Ethan were missed by multiple  
OL,11,Fagencies.                              
